<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.680
CHAPTER 64

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:25.560
THE HEART'S DARKNESS THE SUIKO REFLECTS

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:41.510
I have no home to return to... anymore.

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.520
Over here...

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.770
This way...

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.850
Here...

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.210
Come.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.590
Is it... calling me?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.120
Here...

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.120
Here...

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.420
I'm right here.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.440
I've been waiting for you...

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.430
Shoko Tatsukawa.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:25.680
How do you... know my name?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.890
What torments you?

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.680
What happened?

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:34.310
You'll listen... to me?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.040
Indeed I shall.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.880
Tell me everything.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:46.380
Three months ago, the company my husband
worked for folded so we came to this town.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.330
With our son, the three of us
wanted to start a new life.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:56.860
Do you wish to be free from that torment?

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:58.420
I do.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.590
That's why I came here.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:03.590
I shall grant you your wish.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.240
What?

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:09.040
Free me from this container...

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:12.480
and I shall free you, too.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.190
Open the lid.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.690
Open it now!

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.250
SUIKO

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.220
You thought I would eat you, didn't you?

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:44.010
And yet... you didn't care.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.800
Fear not. I shall keep my promise.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.960
<i>That couldn't have been real.</i>

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:06.970
<i>That tiger </i>yokai<i> was</i>
<i>an illusion created by my mind.</i>

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.200
Isao-san?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:14.500
Why are you home so early?
You usually have overtime...

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.630
I'm not going to work for a while.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.340
I've been suspended.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.670
What do you mean?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.440
It was an executive order.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:25.930
Can't you even get one contract?!
You're worthless!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.890
You don't deserve a salary!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.470
Don't come to work until I say so!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.970
But that's completely unfair!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.540
You know, don't you?

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:41.820
It's not just the office.
President Onikubo controls the whole town.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.240
Resist him, and you won't survive.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.570
But...!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.090
Get out!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.930
Leave me alone.

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:53.790
All right.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.100
I'm going shopping.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:01.670
I only worked in engineering
at my last job!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:07.200
You can't expect me to come to a new town,
work in sales and actually be useful!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.970
Come on! Hurry and go get it!

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.480
Lame!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:20.880
Ren!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.400
Are you okay?!

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.990
I told you
telling the school was pointless!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.860
Even the teachers are
scared of Onikubo-kun!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.700
Just leave me alone!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:54.810
I haven't seen Rat Man around recently.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.140
Now that you mention it...

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.890
Let's hope he's not off
causing trouble again.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.540
Yes.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.770
Ah, hello? Shoko Tatsukawa-san?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:10.280
I'm President Onikubo's secretary,
BiBiBi no Rat Man.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.700
<i>You haven't shown up to today's
women's association meeting.</i>

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.960
<i>The missus is quite upset.</i>

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.850
I see. I'll be right there.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:28.920
You handsome devil!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.430
You're slow! Hurry up!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.850
Why were you so late?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.060
I wasn't told there was a meeting today.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.730
Oh? You're saying
I didn't tell you on purpose?

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.230
I didn't mean...

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.560
Then apologize properly.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:47.000
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.700
You call that an apology?

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.660
I don't sense sincerity.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.570
On your hands and knees!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.330
Rub your forehead on the ground
like you were meant to.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:01.770
Otherwise your family might
suffer the consequences.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.110
I'm truly...

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:10.510
very sorry.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.570
How pathetic!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.480
Get out!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.350
Just leave me alone!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.300
Why...

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.620
does this...

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.460
happen to me?

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.120
What are you muttering about?

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.230
Why...

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.880
-Why? Why? Why? Why?
-What are you getting up for?!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.090
Who gave you permission?!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.550
O-Oh my...

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:58.050
Free me...

00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.700
Huh?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:04.620
...from... this torment.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.040
Free me!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.220
Th-This is bad!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.180
Is this... a dream?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.310
An illusion?

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:45.330
No. I've come to fulfill my promise.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.730
What's going on?!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.480
Are you causing this?!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.980
Then help me!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.780
Are you listening?!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.510
That's an order!

00:09:57.720 --> 00:10:00.350
Have you been freed?

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.890
I see. Then let's continue.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:17.450
What a shocker!
That woman's controlling a <i>yokai</i>!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.800
This could be profitable...

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.310
Ren ain't here?
He's probably cutting school.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.520
Go to his home and drag him out! Got it?

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.270
Okay.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.810
Is bullying that fun?

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.480
Of course it's fun!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.490
It's the best way to kill time.
Who the hell are you?

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:38.990
The bullied are suffering. They're scared.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.370
You don't like being scared, do you?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.540
Who do you think I am?!

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:47.330
I'm Onikubo's son!
I ain't scared of nothing!

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.330
Oh.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:52.310
Then I'll teach you.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.070
Well?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.850
How do you feel?

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:03.470
I-I'm scared!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.140
Really?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.470
Good.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.570
Oh my word! Yusuke-kun was...!

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:15.170
Call President Onikubo right away!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:22.530
Have you been freed from your torment now?

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.970
No. Not yet.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.790
Kitaro, apparently a <i>yokai</i>'s on the loose.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.590
That's the Suiko!

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:32.540
The Suiko?

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:36.380
A real problem <i>yokai</i>'s
been unleashed here.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:39.550
Kitaro, we have to stop him at once!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.920
Yes, Dad.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.410
ONIKUBO FOODS

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.510
I-It's an emergency, Mr. President!

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:46.720
Y-Your wife and son...!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.940
Aiko! Yusuke!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:52.940
Wh-What's going on?! How did this happen?!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.360
In that case
I may have just the news for you.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:12:00.300
But, before that, I would require
an informant fee...

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:06.290
You impudent little rat!
Now tell me what you know!

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:07.280
Here...

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.580
Are you joking?!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.540
No, no. The important stuff's coming up.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.190
Yusuke!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.540
This woman...!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:22.930
That's right! That woman's controlling the
<i>yokai</i> that attacked your wife and child.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.220
Tatsukawa's wife!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.220
S-Stop!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.610
Humans are being mummified!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:43.530
Stop him quickly!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.470
Right!

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:49.290
Suiko, stop attacking humans!

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.040
Unfortunately, I can't.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.040
I've promised
I would grant this woman's wish!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:56.750
Who are you?

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.800
A little more.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:01.300
A little more and I'll be free.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.130
So... get out of my way!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.970
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:17.230
What is that <i>yokai</i>?! At this rate
Kitaro will be mummified, too!

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.660
Stop, Suiko!

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:33.410
So you came to me.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.660
Now I don't have to look for you...

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:38.670
Mrs. Tatsukawa.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.670
SPIRIT HAIR CHANCHANKO

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:47.180
SUIKO

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.070
-<i>"Oh, what should I do?"</i>
-<i>"I was sleeping."</i>

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.070
<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.160
He got away...

00:13:54.960 --> 00:14:00.190
Answer me! Did you have
that tiger <i>yokai</i> attack Aiko and Yusuke?!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.440
That's right.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.690
Why?!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.820
Why did you do that?!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:09.540
I built this company
up to this size from nothing.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.870
My company maintains
this town's economy now!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.960
Compared to that, what's your family?

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:20.730
They're worthless trash!
Bugs that don't deserve to live!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:25.190
I let you live and this is how
you repay my kindness?!

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.090
I'll kill you!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.930
You and your worthless husband and kid...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.700
I'll make you all suffer
before I kill you!

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:39.650
I'll write you all off
as accidental deaths!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:40.650
Uh, and me?

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.610
An accidental death!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.750
Of course.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.990
Prepare yourself!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.460
Wh-What the...?!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.140
You came.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:05.130
Y-You're the thing that killed my family!

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.510
You can disappear too.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.970
Screw you! I won't let you
take what I've built up fr--

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.540
At last I'm free...

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.730
from that torment.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:21.960
Thank you.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.610
No. Not yet.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.670
Huh?

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:33.490
Say, Kitaro, who was that woman?

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.740
Something about
"a little more" and "being free."

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:41.500
The Suiko was originally a liquid <i>yokai</i>
without form.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:45.880
He takes the form of a tiger to
reflect the darkness in people's hearts.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.500
The darkness in their hearts?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.990
Dark, twisted emotions like
rage and hate.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:55.350
Let's find her.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.480
But to find her...

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.020
I know all about that woman.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.520
Rat Man?!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.610
That woman's taking revenge

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:07.960
on all the horrible people
who tormented her.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:10.280
Shoko...?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.450
Mom might be doing it for me.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.830
So that's why I can't reach the office.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.080
Mom's smiling.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.630
But she seems kind of sad.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.690
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.950
Now we can start over again.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.470
I'm home.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:40.470
Why are you here?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.480
To fulfill my promise to you.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.290
But you already fulfilled...

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:49.980
You didn't!

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:01.920
Wh-Why did you...?

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.540
It was what you wanted.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:08.920
Me? No! I never wanted this!

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.340
But you did.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.420
I can see your heart.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.430
You...

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:20.600
felt your family had changed
and you didn't want them anymore.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.160
No! No, no, no!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.780
I didn't...

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:31.690
This town is still full

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:37.240
of people who tormented you
on Onikubo's orders.

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.420
Here's the place.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.890
Later. I got stuff to do.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.590
Kitaro, look.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.300
Oh my goodness!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:57.970
When I'd given up on everything
and went to the mountains,

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:00.660
I should have just
jumped into the waterfall.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.520
I never should have
asked that <i>yokai</i> to help me.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.000
It's all my fault...

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:12.650
Regretting it won't solve anything.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:17.380
We have to stop the Suiko
or there'll be more victims.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:19.160
Where's the Suiko?

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.810
I don't know.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.560
I see.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.670
I'm sorry...

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.450
Isao-san... Ren...

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:44.600
<i>That </i>yokai<i> is my own corrupted heart.</i>

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>I have to do something about it myself!</i>

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:59.360
I'll drain you of your fluids as well.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.490
Oh no! We're out of options!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.370
Kitaro!

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.630
It's all my fault!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.550
That's why I...!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:29.440
That's it! The Suiko's weakness is...

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:32.190
Spray all of that coolant at me!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:33.530
But...

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:36.190
It's okay. Trust me.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.700
You nuisance!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.660
Disappear!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.920
Finger Guns!

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.520
Kitaro!

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:20.860
Now all the mummified people
should return to normal.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.800
Shoko-san, isn't that...

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.010
Shoko Tatsukawa-san.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.700
You still have

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.740
a home to return to.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.750
Shoko.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:51.270
Mom.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.520
Isao-san... Ren!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.860
That woman won't get away with this!

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:02.030
I'll make her life even worse than before!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.410
I'll help, too!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:06.530
Mr. President! Emergency!
The press is swarming us!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:11.500
President Onikubo, you tried to
kill a family and cover it up!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.460
<i>I'll kill you!</i>

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:17.960
<i>You and your worthless husband and kid...
I'll make you all suffer...</i>

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.880
That president's finished now.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.510
You tried to make money off that video.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:27.890
I'm just sayin', you didn't have to post
that video <i>all</i> over the place!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:31.100
Even if you make money,
it's all just easy come, easy go.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.520
Indeed.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:39.150
Let's start over again in a new town.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.130
Yes.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:41.530
Rain?

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:45.260
It's just a passing shower.
It'll let up soon.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.090
You're right.

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:49.220
Over here...

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:52.560
Over here...

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:55.240
I've been...

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.650
waiting for you...

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:04.760
<i>Dad, I've missed Sakaiminato.</i>

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:06.880
<i>Huh? Tottori Prefecture is...?!</i>

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.300
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:12.220
<i>"Nation Founding?!
Mabyo's Great Tottori Empire"</i>

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:15.060
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
